  "processing_notes": {
    "geometry": "One global projective mapping from source quad TL,TR,BR,BL to full rectangular canvas. All quads stay inside original. No local warps, outpainting, cloning or reconstruction. Images without quad keep camera perspective.",
    "white_balance": "Linear sRGB channel gains, tapering from luminance 0.65 to 1.0.",
    "tone": "k=2**ev; Yout=Y*k/(1+(k-1)*Y); highlight term subtracts strength*clip((Yout-0.55)/0.45,0,1)**2. RGB scaled by luminance ratio. Clipped source detail is not recovered.",
    "noise": "No dedicated denoise filter. Lanczos downsampling reduces small digital noise; fine material texture retained.",
    "export": "Each crop rendered directly from uncompressed corrected PNG in temporary workspace, not from a previously compressed WebP. Q95 full / Q91 crops, method6, sRGB ICC, EXIF/GPS stripped. No upscaling.",
    "backgrounds": "Only CTA backgrounds get graphite RGB(24,25,24) overlay. Desktop image blend: 0.24+0.45*clip((x-0.38)/0.62,0,1)**1.3; mobile:0.30. No such overlay on portfolio/full/hero.",
